<Activity mc:Ignorable="sap sap2010" x:Class="Workday_UI_Test_Case" this:Workday_UI_Test_Case.WorkdayUiTimeout="00:00:30" sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="Workday UI test case template (Given / When / Then).&#xA;1. Given: set the stage this test needs in Select the hire run, and the test that produces it.&#xA;2. When: add the Workday steps inside the Workday card (attach to the open Workday tab; never open a new one).&#xA;3. Then: read what Workday shows into actualValue, set expectedValue, and keep the Verify settings (continue on failure, both screenshots, title, output message).&#xA;No Try/Catch here: attach the Workday Test Execution template for failure handling and cleanup." xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/netfx/2009/xaml/activities" xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006" xmlns:njl="clr-namespace:Newtonsoft.Json.Linq;assembly=Newtonsoft.Json" xmlns:s="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Private.CoreLib" xmlns:sap="http://schemas.microsoft.com/netfx/2009/xaml/activities/presentation" xmlns:sap2010="http://schemas.microsoft.com/netfx/2010/xaml/activities/presentation" xmlns:scg="clr-namespace:System.Collections.Generic;assembly=System.Private.CoreLib" xmlns:sco="clr-namespace:System.Collections.ObjectModel;assembly=System.Private.CoreLib" xmlns:t="clr-namespace:Testing_Workday_CrossPlatform;assembly=DataService.Testing_Workday_CrossPlatform" xmlns:this="clr-namespace:" xmlns:ui="http://schemas.uipath.com/workflow/activities" xmlns:uix="http://schemas.uipath.com/workflow/activities/uix" xmlns:uta="clr-namespace:UiPath.Testing.Activities;assembly=UiPath.Testing.Activities" xmlns:uwah="clr-namespace:UiPath.Web.Activities.Http;assembly=UiPath.Web.Activities" xmlns:uwahm="clr-namespace:UiPath.Web.Activities.Http.Models;assembly=UiPath.Web.Activities" xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
